    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269220</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>へぇ……優勝してきたんだね？
さっそく体を見させて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh... So you really won? Let me
take a quick look at your body...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269220</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269220</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……………………………………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269220</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……………………………………
……………………………………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...
...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269220</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……………………………………
…………………………違う……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...No...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>4</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269260</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>へ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269376</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>僕の求めていたのとぜんぜん違う。
……というか、なんだか
強さのオーラが足りないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This isn't what I was
looking for. ...Or rather,
your aura is still too weak.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269436</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……足りないって、なぁ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Too weak, huh?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269476</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うーん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Umm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もっともっと
ハイレベルな強さじゃなきゃダメだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm looking for a much greater
level of strength than this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうじゃないとまだまだ
ソースとして弱い。弱すぎる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>At this level, you're still too weak
to use as reference. Way too weak.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269660</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>じ、じゃあもう少し</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then we'll, uh, fight a bit more.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269732</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>がんばってみます。
待っててくださいね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We'll do our best. Please
wait for just a bit longer.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269788</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、期待しているよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. I've got my hopes pinned on you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
